Hello to all of you! Hope everything is good.

My name is Potyguara, from mappe and I'm here today to talk about our roadmap for CrafTAE 🃏. Here is the plan. 🛣️

[h3]March 2025[/h3]

• Game progression and unlocks;
• Endless mode;
• Save/load game;
• Polish.

[h3]April 2025[/h3]

• Hints and suggestions systems;
• Polish.

[h3]May 2025[/h3]

• Challenge mode (still under consideration);
• Steam achievements;
• Polish.

[h3]June 2025[/h3]

• Polish;
• Steam Next Fest.

[h3]July 2025[/h3]

• Polish and bug fixing;
[b]• Launch on July 21st.[/b]

After that, we are commited on supporting the game with bug fixes and new content in DLC format! Anyway, hope you enjoy! Please share your thoughts below. While you do that, you should check out Balota SZ (brazilian) playing the CrafTAE DEMO, he owned it!

https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V8SMjLwI0F0&t=573

[h1]The DEMO is free, you should play it![/h1]

Have a good game! We'll be back soon.

Cheers!
